<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh November unemployment rises to 4.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Kazakh November unemployment rises to 4.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people officially registered as unemployed in Kazakhstan in November rose slightly to 280,300, or 4.1 percent of the workforce, from 4.0 percent in October, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    KAZAKH UNEMPLOYMENT    Nov 96   Oct 96   Jan-Nov 96</p>
<p>    number unemployed	280,300  275,800  360,800</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce  4.1	4.0	n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are for those officially registered as unemployed.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
